§§ `Dieu 157`

@@qb 539 543
@ref Dieu 157 (src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:539-543)
@@fx `a running contract made in 2022` : `A contract made before the commencement` ; `date the contract was made` = YMD 2022 6 1 ; `the contract is still running on 1 January 2023` = TRUE
@@fx `a running contract made in 2022 and amended to conform` : `A contract made before the commencement` ; `date the contract was made` = YMD 2022 6 1 ; `the contract is still running on 1 January 2023` = TRUE ; `the parties agreed to amend it to conform to this Law and to apply this Law` = TRUE
@@fx `a contract made on the commencement day` : `A contract made before the commencement` ; `date the contract was made` = YMD 2023 1 1 ; `the contract is still running on 1 January 2023` = TRUE
@@fx `a contract made in 2022 that has ended` : `A contract made before the commencement` ; `date the contract was made` = YMD 2022 6 1
#ASSERT `Dieu 157(1): the text that governs the contract` `a running contract made in 2022` EQUALS `the law in force when the contract was made`
#ASSERT `Dieu 157(1): the text that governs the contract` `a running contract made in 2022 and amended to conform` EQUALS `Law 08/2022/QH15`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 157(1): the text that governs the contract` `a contract made on the commencement day`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 157(1): the text that governs the contract` `a contract made in 2022 that has ended`
